  "body": "### What is the issue with the WebHID Standard?\n\nWhen parsing a report, when [encountering a Collection tag](https://hid.spec.whatwg.org/#ref-for-collection-tag%E2%91%A0), step 3 says:\n\n> If the [size](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-size) of usages is greater than 1, remove the first [item](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-item) of usages.\n\nBut this has no observable effect - nothing else reads `usages` until step 5 of the Main item parsing, which states:\n\n> Set usages to be an empty [sequence](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-sequence) of unsigned long.\n\nSo I think we can just delete that step 3.",
